Kotsu, the mascot of the Oracle Bones power

The pictures in this folder were made for this project from the brief in docs/mascot.md.
To the extent there are rights in them, they are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Credit: "Kotsu, Oracle Bones mascot, by Jonathan Andrei".

How they were made: generated on the author's own computer with an open image model
(FLUX.2 klein, Apache 2.0), one picture chosen as the reference and the other poses generated
from it, then cut out of their backgrounds by a script. No prompt names an anime, a studio, a
character or an artist. The prompts and seeds are in art/provenance.json.

The code of this repository is under the MIT licence (LICENSE at the root), not this one.
